OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders unite in call for
OL,4,Anew regional mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses from across Leicester,
OL,7,FLeicestershire and Rutland have united
OL,8,Fin a call for the government to
OL,9,Festablish a regional mayor for the
OL,10,Farea.
OL,12,FThe leaders of the 10 councils that
OL,13,Fcurrently serve the area have written
OL,14,Fto ministers saying a Mayoral Strategic
OL,15,FAuthority (MSA) offers "the strongest
OL,16,Fplatform" to attract funding and
OL,17,Fdeliver economic growth in the future.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
