OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders unite in call for
OL,4,Anew regional mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group has asked the government to
OL,7,Foffer clarity on any potential
OL,8,Ftimetable for setting up an MSA and
OL,9,Fdetails on what funding and devolved
OL,10,Fpowers would be available to the new
OL,11,Fmayor.
OL,13,FCurrent Labour mayor of Leicester Peter
OL,14,FSoulsby said he hoped a regional mayor
OL,15,Fcould be in post by 2028.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
